<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Chile's Masisa raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Chile's Masisa raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it had raised its rating for Chilean forest firm Maderas y Sinteticos S.A. (Masisa) to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Analyst James Meyrick made his recommendation in a Jan 15 report.</p>
<p>-- The company's American Depositary Receipts were off 1/4 to 16-3/8 in New York.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
